    title "Valuing Vintage Jewelry: Gemstones, Rings, Bracelets and Watches by Dr. Lori"
    description "Watch to see how valuing vintage jewelry can help you get bargain #ThriftStoreFinds when #shopping. Don't miss #howto identify gemstones, rings, bracelets, watches and other pieces of #jewelry. Ph.D. Antiques Appraiser Dr. Lori shows secrets to value cameo rings, Art Deco pendants, costume jewelry pins and much more. Don't let these jewelry pieces sell at your estate sale or auction. Valuing vintage jewelry gemstones like sapphires, emeralds, diamonds, and rubies are featured.&#10;&#10;Ask Dr. Lori to appraise your antique and vintage jewelry, estate sale purchase or thrift store find. Attend her antiques appraisal events near you or submit photos on Dr. Lori's website."
