    title "The Online Vintage Jewelry Boom: How a New Generation Sells Antiques on Instagram"
    description "During the pandemic, shoppers have been connecting online with their favorite jewelry sellers, and for some, business has boomed. The global crisis has escalated shopping behaviors we were already seeing, such as buying jewelry online and investing in eco-friendly products like vintage and antiques. Expert curators and savvy Instagram sellers Elizabeth Potts of The Moonstoned and Mia Graffam of Fare Well Fine Jewelry share their consumer insights, like what people are buying, as well as tips and tricks to selling through social media. National Jeweler Senior Editor, Fashion Ashley Davis moderates."
