    title "Vintage Jewelry Christmas Tree Art Project Demo"
    description "I have always loved this retro Christmas craft, and always see these jewelry trees on velvet for sale at antique stores. It's fun and easy to make your own! Use old jewelry you don't wear anymore, include meaningful pieces from family members, or thrift some cool finds. &#10;&#10;All you need is a heavy board (I used a 9x12 canvas panel), a piece of fabric for the background, some pliers and wire cutters, Weldbond adhesive, and hot glue along with your jewelry pieces.&#10;&#10;One-of-a-kind DIY decorations are the best! Happy holidays :)."
