    description "HOW TO MAKE A TABLETOP CHRISTMAS TREE WITH VINTAGE JEWELRY | Christmas DIY Craft/Tutorial&#10;&#10;Products shown:&#10;&#10;24-piece brooch set: https://amzn.to/3kXLpo7 &#10;&#10;Cone floral foam: https://amzn.to/3thQzPy &#10;&#10;Metallic tape (similar): https://amzn.to/3yL5Qtm&#10;&#10;Greening pins: https://amzn.to/3n0BvoA&#10;&#10;Push pins: https://amzn.to/3BGCNJj&#10;&#10;Dotting tool: https://amzn.to/3n7xnDc&#10;&#10;Rhinestone glue: https://amzn.to/3jIdTTF&#10;&#10;Gorilla glue: https://amzn.to/3DOdMhm &#10;&#10;&#10;***********************************************************&#10;&#10;Other videos of interest: &#10;&#10;How to Make a Christmas Wreath Using Vintage Ornaments: https://youtu.be/GgbOkg7niCI &#10;&#10;If you want more Christmas videos, be sure to check out my Christmas decorating playlist! https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-oIkyuzqx3s&#38;list=PLN6rjAAfQfU7qDH9T5HTSR8j0-zVSinXp&#10;&#10;&#10;***********************************************************&#10;&#10;In this video, I show you how I create a tabletop Christmas tree using vintage and vintage-insprired jewelry.  I hope you enjoy!&#10;&#10;***********************************************************&#10;&#10;&#10;FTC: This video is not sponsored.&#10;&#10;Affiliate links or codes may be used, meaning I receive a small percentage of sales made with them.  Shopping via these links helps support my channel but you're under no obligation to use them.&#10;&#10;All opinions expressed are my own and 100% honest.&#10;&#10;#christmas #christmastree #christmasdiy"
