    title "Antique Jewelry Haul | HUGE Thrifted Vintage | Turquoise Silver Victorian | The Recycled Life"
    description "Want to support our upcoming Junk Jaunt in Nebraska!? Visit our website www.the-recycled-life.com to purchase items from this episode starting July 24th 2019 at 3:00 PDT =)&#10;&#10;Check out our new website! www.the-recycled-life.com &#10;For links to our online vintage stores, click on the SHOP OUR VINTAGE tab =) SUBSCRIBE! &#10;&#10;We are Selena and Laura. Just two girls with two completely different styles. We're on a mission to spread style and awareness through vintage and thrifted finds. We love to go picking for vintage and antiques at yard sales, auctions, garage sales, thrift stores, and estate sales. We love old stuff and aren't afraid to dig! Sit back, get inspired, then get involved! &#10;&#10;&#10;Selena's online vintage &#38; antique jewelry shop : https://www.ebay.com/usr/thevintagebombshell&#10;&#10;Laura's online vintage shop www.leftcoastrevivals.com Instagram @LeftCoastRevivals &#10;&#10;Thanks for watching! &#10;&#10;See you in a new episode next Friday! =) &#10;&#10;Want to sign us on a major TV network?...We'd love our own show! ;) For Collaborations, contact Laura at laura.therecycledlife@gmail.com&#10;&#10;LINKS TO POPULAR VIDEOS:&#10;&#10;Laura's Mid Century Modern thrifted bedroom makeover: https://youtu.be/slAMibP6Vj0&#10;&#10;How to shop The Goodwill Bins Outlet like a PRO: https://youtu.be/Wz2pZB4FW8Y&#10;&#10;Come Estate Sale Shopping with Us! : https://youtu.be/69KkM2zwGFo"
