    description "Miriam Haskell Vintage Jewelry Auction Catalog FULL Preview!&#10;Link To Auction:  https://youtu.be/TmbDvrNenGQ&#10;The vintage jewelry in this haul preview auction video is the entire catalog of what's coming up on December 19th at 9:00 p.m. eastern. Subscribe now and make sure you ring the bell and turn on notifications for Hudson Vintage or, text &#34;connect&#34; to 917- 809-7250 so you don't miss out!&#10;#haskellfortheholidays&#10;&#10;In Order Of Appearance&#10;8. Blue And Pink 2 Piece Stickpin With Drop sb 250  (time stamp  .04)&#10;9. Red Glass 2 Piece Stickpin With Drop sb 300  (time stamp  .04)&#10;10. Blue Bead Stick Pin sb 75  (time stamp  .10)&#10;11. Blue And Pink Stick Pin sb 75  (time Stamp  .10)&#10;12. Blue Rose Monte Stick Pin sb 75  (time stamp  .10)&#10;13. Pink Givre Glass Stick Pin sb 120  (time stamp  .13)&#10;14. Red Coral Stick Pin sb 175  (time stamp  .13)&#10;15. Figural Pansy Stick Pin sb 200  (time stamp  .13) &#10;16. Older Gray Pearl Stick Pin sb 85  (time stamp  .18)&#10;17. Older Unsigned Filigree Stick Pin sb 120  (time stamp  .18)&#10;18. Older Multi Colored Floral Stick Pin sb 85 (time stamp  .18)&#10;19. Large Oval Earrings sb 150  (time stamp  .22)&#10;20. Floral And Pearl Drop Earrings sb 150  (time stamp  .26)&#10;21. Tendril Rose Monte And Rhinestone Earrings sb 175  (time stamp  .29)&#10;22. Scroll and Pearl Drop Earrings sb 75  (time stamp  .34)&#10;23. Massive 4&#34; Crest Brooch With Pearls sb 400  (time stamp  .38)&#10;24. Victorian Revival Brooch With Rhinestones, Rose Montes And Pearls sb 250  (time stamp  .41)&#10;25. Figural Crescent Brooch With Heart Shaped Rhinestones sb 250  (time stamp  .45)&#10;26. Very Early Unsigned Crown Brooch With Pearls And Rhinestones sb 175  (time stamp  .50)&#10;27. Floral Brooch With Rhinestones And Pearls sb 120  (time stamp  .54)&#10;28. Long Black Bead Necklace together with short (not Haskell ) Necklace sb 85  (time stamp .58)&#10;  2. Amber Bead Necklace With Real Amber Beads sb 150  (time stamp  1.01)&#10;  1. Amber Pendant Necklace sb 200  (time stamp  1.05)&#10;29. Pearl Necklace With Rhinestone And Pearl Drop sb 225  (time stamp  1.10)&#10;  3. Medallion Necklace sb 400  (time stamp  1.16)&#10;30. Long Pearl Necklace with Rhinestone Sprays sb 200  (time stamp 1.19)&#10;31. Pearl Choker With Amber Beads And Pearl Medallion sb 250  (time stamp 1.24)&#10;  4. Black And Pearl Choker With 3 &#189;&#34; Long Earrings (missing  pearls) sb 200 (time stamp 1.29)&#10;  5. Pearl Cuff Bracelet And 3 &#190;&#34; Long Brooch sb 300  (time stamp  1.38)&#10;32. Gray Pearl Art Deco Four Piece Parure (missing stones) sb 450  (time stamp 1.41)&#10;33. Six Strand Choker With Glowing Red Glass Medallion And Earrings sb 400  (time stamp1.59)&#10;34. Giant Pearl And Filigree Necklace With Giant Pearl Earrings sb 250  (time stamp 2.04)&#10;35. Three Strand Pearl Choker With Victorian Revival Drop And Earrings sb 350 (time stamp 2.09)&#10;  7. Miriam Haskell Black And White Three piece set sb 500  (time stamp  2.18)&#10;  6. Miriam Haskell Clear Lucite And Clear Glass Necklace And Earrings sb 600  (time stamp 2.21)&#10;36. Multi Color Floral And Pearl three Piece Parure sb 800  (time stamp 2.24)&#10;&#10;&#9829;&#65038;  SHOP:  https://shophudsonvintage.com&#10;&#9829;&#65038; SELL OR CONSIGN: hudsonvintage@me.com SUBJECT: Sell Help!&#10;&#9829;&#65038;  MEMBERSHIP:   https://www.patreon.com/hudsonvintage&#10;&#9829;&#65038;  GALAXY:  https://galaxy.live/hudson-vintage&#10;&#9829;&#65038; AMAZON:  https://www.amazon.com/shop/hudsonvintage&#10;&#9829;&#65038; SOCIAL MEDIA:&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/hudsonvintageny/&#10;Instagram:  https://www.instagram.com/hudsonvintage/&#10;&#9829;&#65038; FRIEND MAIL&#10;Hudson Vintage&#10;P.O. BOX 526&#10;Blairstown NJ&#10;07825&#10;&#9829;&#65038; CONTACT ME:&#10;Email: hudsonvintage@me.com&#10;TEXT: 917-809-7250&#10;&#9829;&#65038; JOIN this channel to get access to perks:&#10;https://www.yout