    date "2020-04-24T05:15:00Z"
    title "Thrifted Vintage Jewelry Haul | Repurposing Broken Jewelry | Inside My Personal Collection"
    description "Shop my vintage! https://www.leftcoastrevivals.com&#10;&#10;I had so many big plans for this new channel that have recently been canceled and put on hold, but I am determined to make the best of what time we are all in right now! Something that was requested over on my other channel THE RECYCLED LIFE was a look inside my personal jewelry collection and more jewelry repurposing episodes =) So here you go! &#10;&#10;I am currently working on a few fun design based episodes so stay tuned! &#10;&#10;HUGE THANK YOU for the support and encouragement here on my new channel! Many of you have asked, but Selena and I are NOT breaking up ;) The Recycled Life will continue and we will be thrifting when we are old and gray and YouTube is no longer a thing ;) We have learned so much from each other this past year and have encouraged each other to branch out of our comfort zones. We are both so very excited for what is to come. Thank you for coming along with us! &#10;&#10;Hugs and all the love in the world to everyone right now during this unexpected and difficult time. Lets lift each other up and continue to encourage and inspire each other =) &#10;&#10;Cheers! &#10;Laura&#10;&#10;Shop my vintage: https://www.leftcoastrevivals.com &#10;Instagram: @LeftCoastRevivals&#10;Facebook: Left Coast Revivals &#10;&#10;The Recycled Life:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEDLDyuTial0Jtb3IHCab9A&#10;Shop our vintage jewelry: https://www.the-recycled-life.com&#10;&#10;NEXT BIG JEWELRY SALE - May 27th, 2020 3:00pm Pacific Time only on https://www.the-recycled-life.com&#10;&#10;#VintageJewelry&#10;#VintageJewelryCollection&#10;#ThriftedJewelry"
