    title "Cool 1970s Vintage JEWELRY Haul Mystery Unboxing Unjarring YARD SALE FIND !"
    description "A woman's daughters were selling the contents of their mother's house and this is all of her jewelry -- circa 1970s! Many big 'n bold pieces of costume jewelry here. I was the first one to see the box, I asked if they had jewelry and they pulled it out of the house for me. This was a very lovely yard sale, and I got lots of wonderful items, including this box of old stuff.  I hope you enjoy this video! Please let me know what piece is your favorite.  As always, thanks so much for watching -- please like, share and subscribe if you're so inclined. Hugs, Sandra. &#10;&#10;eBay = https://www.ebay.com/usr/TheFunkyPickleStore&#10;Facebook = https://www.facebook.com/TheFunkyPickleThrifter&#10;Instagram = @TheFunkyPickleThrifter&#10;#1970sJewelry #vintagejewelry #thefunkypicklethrifter #ilovethe70s"
