    description "Hi Everybody ! thanks for joining me on my channel. These bags were mostly gone through ages ago they&#8217;ve been sitting around for a year or two and I had already looked through them and set them aside I have bins and bins of bags that are not doing anything except taking up space in my basement and my mind. I need to go through them and pick what really needs to be thrown out what is craft and what is wearable and what little I really want to keep because I keep way too much. I feel like when i do the sorting while filming I have company and accountability. I keep too much ! If you&#8217;re interested in any of the craft or wearable items please contact me at my email If interested in any of the craft or wearable items but not the things that you heard me say I&#8217;m throwing out because I&#65532; cannot go through the bags . &#10;&#10;thank you so much for watching, subscribing liking and commenting. &#10;&#10;&#10;vintage.discoveries21@gmail.com"
