    step 0
    date "2018-03-24T04:53:34Z"
    title "Vintage Cameo Jewelry - What are Cameos?"
    description "Hi all! Let's learn about cameo jewelry! I'll talk about what cameos are made from, shell carved cameos, coral cameos, identifying cameos both shell and resin, ways to date cameos and how to tell which are more valuable. Vintage Cameo Jewelry - What are Cameos?&#10;&#10;Some sites I discuss:&#10;https://www.jewelryshoppingguide.com/cameo-jewelry-guide/&#10;https://www.interweave.com/article/jewelry/cameos-101-history-creation-value-jewelry-plus-dark-haired-cameo/&#10;https://www.wikihow.com/Tell-if-a-Cameo-Is-Authentic&#10;http://www.ebay.com.au/gds/How-to-Tell-a-Real-Cameo-from-a-Fake-/10000000181849716/g.html&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xNLOuqolA7I&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C-hCRbVwdOE&#38;t=468shttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QZgyHmpX5Fo&#10;&#10;&#10;40 FREE Etsy Listings Promo - http://etsy.me/2nLNlDw&#10;Printful Sign Up - https://www.printful.com/a/texasgaltreasures&#10;&#10;Want to help support the Texas Gal Treasures Channel?&#10;http://PayPal.Me/texasgaltreasures&#10;&#10;Shop Amazon with my Affiliate Link:&#10;http://amzn.to/2CXEnIY&#10;&#10;Amazon Influencer-&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/texasgaltreasures&#10;&#10;Amazon Lists---&#10;&#10;My Shirts:&#10;Merch Shirts - http://a.co/eWtBRQj&#10;&#10;Tools I Use:&#10;Homeschooling - http://a.co/cm6eqew&#10;Photography - http://a.co/dnCK0Q8&#10;Packing &#38; Shipping - http://a.co/06WkASb&#10;Jewelry Tools - http://a.co/8Qfh27t&#10;&#10;Merch Links-&#10;Merch Patreon- https://www.patreon.com/texasgaltreasures&#10;Make Shirts Online - http://make-merch.com/&#10;Graphic Stock 7 Day Free Trial - Go to https://videoblocks.go2cloud.org/SH8Y&#10;Merch Informer Coupon Code -https://merchinformer.com/122.html&#10;Coupon Code : TexasGal    for 20% off your order&#10;&#10;TubeBuddy - https://www.tubebuddy.com/TexasGal&#10;&#10;Facebook Groups &#10;Jewelry Lovers and Sellers- http://texasgaltreasures.com/jewelry-group/&#10;International League of Thrifters - https://www.facebook.com/groups/internationalleagueofthrifters &#10;Thrifty Frugal Moms and Dads - https://www.facebook.com/groups/1507909059266870/&#10;&#10;Some of the tools I use: &#10;Metal Testing Kit I got: http://amzn.to/1QbyWqV&#10;Jewelry Magnet:  http://amzn.to/2bAPcW&#10;Jeweler's Loupe:  http://amzn.to/2bECrvQ&#10;Keychain Loupe: http://amzn.to/2bTaD3c&#10;Ring Sizer: http://amzn.to/2bVyMG4&#10;Bakelite Testing: http://amzn.to/2bk1FNK&#10;Pop Up Photo Tent: http://amzn.to/28Rw6q9&#10;Poly bag combo pack: http://amzn.to/1PT8wvT&#10;Poly Mailers: http://amzn.to/1Wr84Wi&#10;Scale: http://amzn.to/1PT8OTq&#10;Canon G7x - http://amzn.to/2ad5OAZ&#10;Small Photo Tent: http://amzn.to/2xvss6s&#10;Diamond Tester: http://amzn.to/2ydZTcG&#10;&#10;Social Media Links &#10;My Website - http://texasgaltreasures.com&#10;Facebook - http://facebook.com/texasgaltreasures&#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/TXgaltreasures&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/texasgaltreasures&#10;Pinterest - https://www.pinterest.com/TXgaltreasures&#10;Snapchat - TexasMargaret&#10;&#10;Contact Info:&#10;*Mailbox*&#10;PO Box 825&#10;Friendswood, TX&#10;77549&#10;&#10;Email - texasgaltreasures@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:  The information on my channel is not intended as expert advice.  Views expressed here are my opinion and what I have learned and experienced personally.  Viewers are encouraged to inform themselves thoroughly and find all points of view that apply to them.  Unless indicated otherwise, I am not sponsored by anyone to endorse nor critique any products.  All comments, opinions, and views are my own.  Links may contain affiliate referrals.&#10;&#10;#texasgaltreasures #shellcameos #cameojewelry #jewelryjarunboxing #jewelryhaul #amazonmerch #etsyseller #ebayseller #jewelrylover #mompreneur #etsy #ebay #sales #reselling #sellingonline #merchbyamazon #printondemand #merch #reseller #ebayseller #etsyseller"
