    label "G2jCsahVBDk"
    step 0
    date "2021-07-09T04:08:14Z"
    title "From Flight Attendant to Vintage Jewelry Store Owner (How to Start $4,000,000 business in Singapore)"
    description "Another great business idea for 2021. The story of Brenda Kang who started a jewelry business company. We discussed how much money you can make on it. Brenda gave advice about sales and marketing for small business owners. And we also discussed the cost of living in Singapore and business opportunities here.&#10;&#10;ABOUT THIS CHANNEL:&#10;Hey! I'm Max. This channel is for those who like to know more about lifestyle business, social media marketing, and life in Singapore. Two videos per week. Enjoy! &#128536;&#10;&#10;LET'S BE FRIENDS:&#10;&#9658; My Instagram (use translate button to read the posts &#128519;): https://www.instagram.com/chernov_networking&#10;&#9658; Sponsorship related requests: maxim.chernov.msc@gmail.com&#10;&#10;CHECK OUT:&#10;&#9658; Brenda Kang on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/revivaljewels&#10;&#9658; Revival Vintage Jewels store: https://www.revivaljewels.com&#10;&#10;TIMESTAMPS:&#10;0:00 Introduction - Who is Brenda Kang?&#10;1:12 Brenda&#8217;s career path and how she found her passion&#10;3:04 How did she feel about changes in life&#10;3:36 Work in Christie&#8217;s after just one course &#10;4:32 Inside Brenda&#8217;s store (Revival Vintage Jewels Singapore) - one of her favorite item&#10;5:29 What was she doing in Christie&#8217;s &#10;6:42 How does Brenda manage her Instagram?&#10;7:59 Crazy clients and gold teeth from New York&#10;9:44 The most expensive item that Brenda sold in Christie&#8217;s&#10;10:27 How to start a jewelry business&#10;12:56 Salary and compensation in the jewelry business&#10;14:04 How much money did she need to start a jewelry business in Singapore? &#10;14:54 The main challenges in the beginning&#10;16:48 The feelings about her first sale &#10;18:02 Who is a good salesperson?&#10;20:08 How to deal with people with money?&#10;21:46 The most expensive item that Brenda ever sold&#10;22:01 How to reduce the risk when you sell million-dollar goods?&#10;22:42 Jewelry business in numbers: revenue and volume of sales&#10;24:08 How big is her team in Singapore? &#10;24:25 Inside the store in Singapore: the oldest item&#10;25:59 Instagram for jewelry business&#10;27:22 How many clients came from Instagram?&#10;28:15 How she makes photos for Instagram? &#10;29:11 What&#8217;s more important on Instagram: personality or jewelry? &#10;32:30 About life in Singapore: Is it expensive?&#10;33:37 How much money does Brenda spend per month living in Singapore (cost of living in Singapore)&#10;&#10;....&#10;Hey! I'm Max. This channel is for those who like to know more about life in Singapore, social media marketing trends globally, and to hear the stories of lifestyle business owners from all over the world. Two videos per week &#8211; Monday and Thursday 5 pm Singapore time. Enjoy! &#128536;&#10;&#10;*Links above include affiliate commission or referrals. I'm part of an affiliate network and I receive compensation from partner websites. The content is accurate as of the posting date but may not be accurate in the future.&#10;&#10;#MaxinAsia"
