    title "Jewelry Haul Unboxing 013 | Vintage Jewelry from Auction"
    description "*SOLD*&#10;05:05 - Blue/Purple Glass Beads&#10;06:40 - Sand Dollar w/ Turtle Necklace &#38; Earring Set&#10;22:31 - Miniature Clocks&#10;&#10;In this video I will be doing a traditional jewelry unboxing. This jewelry unboxing weighs only 3 lbs.!! Since this lot is smaller than normal the video it will not be edited in high speed.&#10;&#10;Are you interested in purchasing an item directly from us? If so, you can contact us at krakenkristeen@gmail.com. All purchase requests are on a first come first serve basis on video slides that include a sale price. In order to help our team find your request quickly, please type the following into the subject line of your email: Purchase Request: Video Number&#10;&#10;If you do not not include &#34;Purchase Request&#34; in your email subject line, we will not see it when we filter our inbox. If you sent the email correctly you will receive an auto reply with plenty of FAQ to help walk you through our process.&#10;&#10;You can find us on Rumble:&#10;https://rumble.com/register/KrakenKrates/&#10;&#10;You can also visit our online stores:&#10;&#10;Kraken Krates eBay store:&#10;https://www.ebay.com/str/krakenkrates&#10;&#10;*If you click on the &#8220;Save this seller&#8221; on our eBay store, you will receive an auto notification when we list new items.&#10;&#10;Kraken Krates Poshmark closet: &#10;https://poshmark.com/closet/kraken_krates&#10;&#10;#krakenkrates&#8203;&#8203; #vintagejewelry&#8203;&#8203; #reseller&#10;&#10;&#128210; &#128210; Timecodes &#128210; &#128210;&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;01:48 ICING Necklace&#10;16:29 Napier Pearl Necklace&#10;17:07 Crown Trifari Bracelet&#10;20:04 Monet Brooch (Pretzel)&#10;20:32 Italian Mosaic Bracelet&#10;21:36 Monet Bracelet (Gold)&#10;24:13 Art In Motion Cat Jacketed Earrings&#10;25:40 Judy Lee Carnival Glass Bracelet&#10;27:55 Miriam Haskell Glass Beaded Necklace&#10;31:01 End Card&#10;&#10;Music:&#10;&#128315;&#10;&#34;MBB - Happy&#34; is licensed under a  Creative Commons License.&#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: https://youtu.be/smFGrm5lf0g&#10;&#128314;&#10;&#10;About:&#10;Thank you for visiting Kraken Krates with Paul and Kristeen on YouTube!&#10;&#10;We are part-time resellers on eBay.  We&#8217;re based out of sunny, family-friendly (not to mention hot) Surprise, Arizona! We opened our first eBay account in 1999 and then began selling LEGO as a hobby. We have since expanded our catalog to include anything and everything we can to flip for a profit to help support ourselves and our five children.&#10;&#10;Join us on our journey to search for items we can resell from estate sales, local and online auctions, liquidation centers, yard sales, thrift stores, charity shops, and basically any weird stuff left on the curb. We also share our tips and tricks!"
