    date "2021-08-22T00:19:08Z"
    title "2021.08.21 Another Vintage Jewelry Haul"
    description "My Etsy shop: VintageBoutiqueCali&#10;https://www.etsy.com/shop/VintageBoutiqueCali?ref=search_shop_redirect&#10;&#10;My eMail address: VintageBoutiqueCali@Yahoo.com&#10;&#10;2021.08.21 Another Vintage Jewelry Haul&#10;&#10;Jen and I had such a good time last week &#34;treasure hunting&#34; at Kobey's Swap Meet (http://kobeyswap.com/) in San Diego, CA, so we decided to go back again this morning and see what we could find ... and we scored!  Just sit back, relax and come see what fun treasures could not be left behind! :)&#10;&#10;100% of everything is for sale, so if there is anything you are interested in purchasing, please visit my Etsy shop (link above) and/or send me an email with the time stamp(s) and the piece(s) you are interested in, and I&#8217;ll get back to you promptly.&#10;&#10;I thoroughly enjoy hunting/searching for and picking specific pieces of vintage sterling silver and costume jewelry I like and then offering them to folks like you who may want to purchase and/or collect them from the comfort of your own living room. &#10;&#10;*** UPCOMING STERLING AUCTION *** &#10;If you're interested (or know someone who may be), please mark your calendars for Sunday, August 29th (beginning at 4:30PM Pacific or 7:30PM Eastern) because Cindy (a.k.a. &#34;Jewelry Nurse&#34; on YouTube) is being gracious enough to host me on her channel again for another live sterling silver auction. I will be on her channel (link provided below) so please subscribe to her channel if you are not already and be watching for us on the 29th! I have some great things in store for you, including free giveaways, so come join us. As usual, you don't have to purchase anything ... just come join the chat and let's have some fun!!! :) &#10;* Cindy's channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6qWJmo_wyhNMZuOM0H7CVQ &#10;&#10;Lastly, if you have any constructive feedback and/or recommendations for me on how I can improve my YouTube content, I solicit and welcome your ideas! &#10;&#10;Thanks! &#10;Doug &#10;&#10;#sandiego #fleamarket #vintagejewelry #midcentury #jewelry"
